  "texto": "# Day One\n@energy 5\n> A knowing question that builds energy.\n\n**Starting** a new job tomorrow? [up]\nRelax, that's what Day One is for.\nIt's the app that **organizes** your first week.\nIt keeps names, schedules and tasks in **one** place.\nIt **reminds** you when to leave so you arrive early.\nAnd before each meeting, it shows who you'll be **talking** to.\nYou'll never forget your boss's name again!\nIt's free and works on any phone.\n[loud]Download Day One and start on the right **foot**.[/loud]\n[fast]Some features require sign-up.[/fast]\n\n# Always Ready\n@energy 5\n> A rushed scene at first, relief and energy at the end.\n\nYour alarm goes off **late** and there's no time to iron.\nYour shirt is wrinkled and the bus leaves in ten minutes.\nWith Always Ready, that's not a **problem**.\nIt's the shirt that **never** wrinkles.\nPull it out of your bag and it looks freshly ironed.\nIt's **cool**, soft and dries in a few hours.\nPerfect for trips, meetings and first **days**!\nIt comes in white, light blue and gray.\n[loud]Buy Always Ready and look sharp, **always**.[/loud]\n[fast]Machine wash cold. Do not bleach.[/fast]\n\n# Sure Voice\n@energy 5\n> A firm fact at first and growing excitement.\n\nPublic speaking is one of the most **common** fears.\nAnd on your first day, someone always asks you to **introduce** yourself.\nWith Sure Voice, you learn to do it without shaking.\nIt's a short public speaking course, one hundred percent online.\nBreathing, posture and voice, in **ten**-minute lessons.\nYou practice with recorded exercises and get feedback from a **coach**.\nIn two weeks you'll notice the **difference**!\nWho doesn't want to make a great first impression? [up]\n[loud]Sign up for Sure Voice and speak with **confidence**.[/loud]\n[fast]Certificate included when you complete the course.[/fast]\n\n# Daily Route\n@energy 5\n> Start with energy, city rhythm!\n\nYour laptop deserves to travel **protected**!\nDaily Route is the backpack designed for your work.\nIt has a **padded** compartment for your computer.\nPockets for your charger, your headphones and your **keys**.\nIts fabric resists rain and doesn't get **dirty** easily.\nAnd its design is **sleek**, for the office or the university.\nDo you ride a bike? [up]\nIt has reflective details so drivers can see you at night.\n[loud]Take Daily Route and start your day **organized**.[/loud]\n[fast]One-year warranty.[/fast]\n\n# Good Start\n@energy 5\n> A warm scene at first, lots of energy at the end.\n\nIt's eight o'clock, you're outside your new office and you skipped breakfast.\nYour stomach is louder than your **nerves**.\nJust around the corner is Good Start.\n**Fresh** coffee, natural juices and hot sandwiches.\nEverything ready to go in **under** three minutes.\nAnd on your first day, the coffee is on **us**!\nJust show your work badge.\nWe'll welcome you with a smile, every **weekday**.\n[loud]Stop by Good Start and kick off with **energy**.[/loud]\n[fast]One promotion per person.[/fast]\n\n# Your Mentor\n@energy 5\n> An empathetic question, finishing with lots of strength.\n\nAfraid you won't know what to **ask** at your new job? [up]\nThat's normal, and you don't have to go through it without support.\nYour Mentor stays with you for your **first** thirty days.\nEach week you talk with someone who's already been **there**.\nThey help you get organized and understand the unwritten rules.\nEvery decision gets easier with a guide.\nSessions are by **video** and last half an hour.\nStarting with company changes **everything**!\nThousands of people have already tried it.\n[loud]Book your first session **free** with Your Mentor.[/loud]\n[fast]Extra sessions with a monthly plan.[/fast]\n\n# Get There\n@energy 5\n> A quick fact at first and city energy.\n\nIn the city, a **bike** often beats a car on short trips.\nAnd with Get There, you won't even **sweat**.\nIt's an electric bike that **folds** in ten seconds.\nIt fits in the elevator, under your desk or on the **subway**.\nIts battery lasts up to **forty** kilometers.\nGoodbye, morning traffic!\nCharge it at any outlet, just like your phone.\nWant to arrive on time for your first day? [up]\n[loud]Try Get There and be **punctual**, every day.[/loud]\n[fast]Trial subject to availability in your city.[/fast]\n\n# Clear Note\n@energy 5\n> Lots of energy, like revealing a brilliant trick!\n\nWrite by hand and keep everything on your **phone**!\nClear Note is a smart notebook.\nWrite with its pen and your notes are **saved** in the app.\nSearch any word, even if your handwriting is **messy**.\nGreat for meetings, trainings and **to-do** lists.\nFilled up the notebook? [up]\nWipe the pages with a damp cloth and **start** again.\nOne notebook for the whole year!\n[loud]Buy Clear Note and forget **nothing** at your new job.[/loud]\n[fast]Pen with refills included.[/fast]\n"
